# SEO pages (PetCalc)

Synced with `scripts/audit/lib.mjs` `LIMITS` and `scripts/audit/seo.mjs`. Full playbook: `docs/SEO-PLAYBOOK.md`. Keyword ownership: `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md`.

## Metadata (every indexable page)

- **Title**: 30–65 characters (hard max 80); primary keyword near the start; unique site-wide.
- **Meta description**: 70–160 characters (hard max 200); one clear value prop; includes primary keyword once.
- **One H1** only, aligned with title intent (not identical boilerplate on every page).
- **Canonical**: pass `canonicalPath` to `BaseLayout`; absolute URL via `siteUrl`; trailing slash (`trailingSlash: 'always'`).
- **Open Graph**: title, description, url; prefer a real `og:image` in `public/` (1200×630).

## Content minimums (body copy, not boilerplate alone)

| Page kind | Min words |
|-----------|-----------|
| Tool (`src/pages/tools/*/index.astro`) | 600 |
| Guide (`src/pages/guides/*/index.astro`) | 800 |
| Hub (`/tools/`, `/dogs/`, `/cats/`, `/guides/`) | 150 unique intro |
| Legal/trust | 150 |

Tools must include: answer-first paragraph, how-to, formula/explanation, worked example, assumptions, FAQ (≥4), sources (≥3), disclaimer, ≥2 related internal links.

## Keywords

- One **primary keyword** per URL — must match a row in `docs/KEYWORD-MAP.md`.
- Secondary phrases stay on the owning page only; never reuse another page's primary term as your H1 target.
- Do not create separate URLs for synonym variants of the same task (fan-out trap).

## Technical

- `lang` on `<html>`, viewport meta present.
- Images: descriptive `alt` text; decorative images use empty alt.
- `/404/` and `/embed/` are not sitemap targets; 404 is `noindex`.
- JSON-LD: see `structured-data` skill; no fake ratings.

## Before merge

```bash
npm run build && npm run audit:seo && npm run check:links
```

Fix errors; treat `AUDIT_PROD=1` failures as launch blockers.
